00:14:10,930 --> 00:14:13,030
我们为啥会用我名字来当店名
Why did we name the company after me?

347
00:14:13,330 --> 00:14:14,430
"敦亲睦邻小蛋糕"对比
"Neighbor Cakes" versus

348
00:14:14,430 --> 00:14:16,350
"麦克斯自恋小蛋糕"
"Max's narcissistic cupcakes"?

349
00:14:17,010 --> 00:14:18,870
没事的 理智线别断
We're fine. Don't freak out.

350
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:20,510
跟着我们的计划走 照搬家里那套
Just do our thing, like we did at home.

351
00:14:20,670 --> 00:14:21,490
不必恐慌
No need to panic.

352
00:14:22,350 --> 00:14:26,610
倒数5 4 3 2...
In five, four, three, two...

353
00:14:26,610 --> 00:14:27,170
大家好啊
Yo, what's up?

354
00:14:27,190 --> 00:14:28,770
我是"麦克斯自制小蛋糕"的麦克斯
I'm Max, of Max's Homemade Cupcakes.

355
00:14:28,942 --> 00:14:31,198
是"卖客湿"自制小蛋糕 懂吗
They're "Hoe-made." Ha! Get it?

356
00:14:31,198 --> 00:14:33,453
因为她是来卖的
'cause she's a hoe!

357
00:14:34,550 --> 00:14:35,670
她有大"胸器"
She's got the boobs,

358
00:14:35,670 --> 00:14:37,250
我有好头脑 对吧 麦克斯
And I've got the brains, right, Max?

359
00:14:37,690 --> 00:14:39,530
算是吧
Uh, kind of.

360
00:14:39,830 --> 00:14:42,010
我们的小蛋糕都是在家里烘焙的 环境...
We bake at home in our apartment, which is--

361
00:14:42,010 --> 00:14:44,970
简直就像飓风扫过 真的很惨哦
Is a disaster area. Really, it's a mess.

362
00:14:44,970 --> 00:14:46,090
而且我们还付不起房租
And we don't have our rent.

363
00:14:46,470 --> 00:14:49,530
付不起房租 贵到我想哭
The rent is high, not gonna lie.

364
00:14:49,590 --> 00:14:52,331
可怜无人助 也无男人顾
we hung out to dry, neither has a guy

365
00:14:52,331 --> 00:14:55,110
咋样啊 决战小蛋糕之巅 对吧 麦克斯
Yo, what up, Cupcake Wars? Right, Max?

366
00:14:57,348 --> 00:14:58,410
我不知道现在是怎样
I don't even know what's happening.

367
00:14:58,410 --> 00:15:01,130
我们开始烘焙是因为我家破产
We bake because I lost all my money

368
00:15:01,130 --> 00:15:02,670
而且她妈是酒鬼
and her mom drinks.

369
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:07,510
对了 我是卡洛琳 就此结束
Oh, I'm Caroline... and, cut.

370
00:15:09,930 --> 00:15:13,190
好吧 行
Okay. Well, okay.

371
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:15,770
我刚才即兴唱了段饶舌吗
Did I just freestyle rap?

372
00:15:16,870 --> 00:15:17,590
是的
Yes.

373
00:15:18,570 --> 00:15:20,770
你还在家园被飓风淹没的女人面前
And you also called our apartment a disaster

374
00:15:20,770 --> 00:15:23,390
说我们的家像是被飓风扫过一般
in front of two ladies whose apartments washed away.

375
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:27,046
你们俩没事吧
Hi. Everything okay over here?

376
00:15:27,046 --> 00:15:29,188
傻逼人与胸器逼人一切正常
Yep. Ditz and double-D's, on track.

377
00:15:29,690 --> 00:15:31,270
-介绍自己的品牌特色 -很好
- B.Y.O.B. - Great.

378
00:15:31,510 --> 00:15:33,550
都来到台前 我将公布今天的神秘材料
Can we all gather to reveal the secret ingredients?

379
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:36,590
-会是什么材料啊 -都有可能啊
- What's it gonna be? - It could be anything.

380
00:15:36,730 --> 00:15:38,970
在圣帕特里克节主题集中 有支队伍做了
I once saw a St. Patrick's day theme where a team made

381
00:15:38,970 --> 00:15:40,390
啤酒幸运符小蛋糕
a beer and lucky charms cupcake.

382
00:15:40,490 --> 00:15:42,290
那方面你很专长 希望是那个主题
That's right up your alley. I hope it's that.

383
00:15:42,470 --> 00:15:43,750
今日的主题是
Today's theme is...

384
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:45,070
灵魂食物[黑人食物]
Soul food.

385
00:15:46,330 --> 00:15:47,590
我们一定行的 姐妹
Ooh, we got this, sister!

386
00:15:47,650 --> 00:15:48,850
胜券在握了 爽哟
Sister, this is gotten. Whoo-hoo!

387
00:15:50,770 --> 00:15:52,270
材料包含有
Some of the ingredients include

388
00:15:52,830 --> 00:15:55,790
秋葵 糖蜜 芥蓝 地瓜
okra, molasses, collard greens, sweet potato,

389
00:15:55,990 --> 00:15:57,970
酪乳 鸡 猪蹄膀
buttermilk, chicken, and ham hock.

390
00:15:57,970 --> 00:15:59,330
猪蹄膀
Ham hock?

391
00:15:59,370 --> 00:16:00,690
怎么听起来像魔戒哈比人的名字
Isn't that a character in The Hobbit?

392
00:16:01,730 --> 00:16:03,670
倒数3 2
In three, two...

393
00:16:04,590 --> 00:16:05,490
比赛开始 女孩们
Here we go, girl!

394
00:16:06,990 --> 00:16:08,790
姐妹 我们死定了
Sister, we are screwed.

395
00:16:15,290 --> 00:16:17,390
我们可以做我们的地瓜泥小蛋糕
We can do our sweet potato mash cupcake.

396
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:19,450
再撒上糖蜜花生碎
Ooh, with peanut molasses drizzle.

397
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:21,970
秋葵小蛋糕 秋葵小蛋糕
Gumbo cupcake! Gumbo cupcake!

398
00:16:22,590 --> 00:16:23,510
我们该怎么做
What are we gonna do?

399
00:16:24,310 --> 00:16:25,510
不知道
I don't know.

400
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:28,270
-你在看什么 -摄影机啊
- What are you looking at? - The camera.

401
00:16:29,390 --> 00:16:31,130
新奥尔良 新奥尔良
New Orleans, New Orleans

402
00:16:31,290 --> 00:16:33,170
我们一定行 秋葵小蛋糕
we got this, gumbo cupcakes

403
00:16:33,770 --> 00:16:34,750
卡洛琳 祝你好运
Good luck, Caroline.

404
00:16:35,150 --> 00:16:36,810
不许走 麦克斯 跑什么跑啊
Stop it, Max. What's wrong with you?

405
00:16:37,130 --> 00:16:39,150
最惨的事发生了 我们是这集里的傻蛋
It's happening. We're the dumb-dumbs!

406
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:40,610
我们才不是这集的傻蛋
We are not the dumb-dumbs.

407
00:16:41,690 --> 00:16:42,750
我是沃顿商学院毕业的
I went to Wharton.

408
00:16:43,910 --> 00:16:45,770
我们就选出三个材料吧
All we have to do is pick three ingredients.

409
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:48,610
我们准备好要放进烤箱了
And we're ready to pop them in the oven!

410
00:16:49,150 --> 00:16:51,070
她们怎么这么快就能送入烤箱啦
How can they already be going in the oven?

411
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:52,950
-这让我有个主意 -什么
- Oh, that gives me an idea! - What?

412
00:16:52,950 --> 00:16:54,290
把我放进烤箱吧
Put me in the oven!

413
00:16:55,470 --> 00:16:57,010
没事的 先开始 边做边想吧
Okay, okay. We just have to start.

414
00:16:57,070 --> 00:16:57,850
灵感会来的
It'll come to us.

415
00:16:57,990 --> 00:16:58,490
统统带过去
Bring it all.

416
00:16:59,190 --> 00:17:00,930
这集主题居然是灵魂食物
Just my luck to get soul food

417
00:17:00,930 --> 00:17:02,370
我这没灵魂的人真是超"幸运"啊
when I don't even have a soul.

418
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:04,570
新奥尔良 新奥尔良
New Orleans, New Orleans

419
00:17:04,770 --> 00:17:06,390
我们一定行 秋葵小蛋糕
we got this, gumbo cupcakes

420
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:08,250
这洗不了我的脑的
That is not catching on!

421
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:10,910
你有什么想法呢 麦克斯
So, what are you thinking, Max?

422
00:17:11,450 --> 00:17:13,110
新奥尔良 新奥尔良
New Orleans, New Orleans

423
00:17:13,170 --> 00:17:14,510
我错了 真被洗脑了
I was wrong, it is catching on.

424
00:17:15,010 --> 00:17:16,050
别想那个了
Stop thinking that.

425
00:17:16,150 --> 00:17:17,410
快想要用什么材料
Start thinking about the ingredients,

426
00:17:17,410 --> 00:17:18,310
我一边先准备烘焙
while I do the baking.

427
00:17:18,710 --> 00:17:19,750
我看你做过无数次了
I've seen you do it a million times.

428
00:17:19,790 --> 00:17:21,070
用牛奶就行了 对吧
We just need milk, right, Max?

429
00:17:21,070 --> 00:17:23,110
我们一定行 秋葵小蛋糕
We got this. Gumbo cupcakes

430
00:17:24,610 --> 00:17:25,490
牛奶先拿来
Here's the milk.

431
00:17:25,890 --> 00:17:28,190
我要先倒牛奶进搅拌器
So, I'll just pour this milk into this mixer.

432
00:17:29,390 --> 00:17:31,268
看起来像我在烘焙 对吧 麦克斯
It looks like I'm baking, right, Max?

433
00:17:31,268 --> 00:17:32,950
你眼睛看着呀
Whoa! Watch what you're doing!

434
00:17:32,950 --> 00:17:34,550
淹水啦 发大水啦
It's flooding! It's flooding!

435
00:17:34,910 --> 00:17:36,230
这就喊淹水呢
Oh, great, you said "flooding."

436
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:37,950
等等喊啥 防灾部跟飓风避难所了吗
What's next, "FEMA?" "Superdome?"

437
00:17:38,150 --> 00:17:39,450
这真是场灾难
This is a disaster.

438
00:17:39,550 --> 00:17:41,090
我们是节目史上最烂的一组了
We are the worst team ever.

439
00:17:41,230 --> 00:17:43,470
我们才不是呢 你在干嘛
We are not. What are you doing?

440
00:17:43,590 --> 00:17:45,230
偷点虾子带回家啊
Putting shrimp in my pocket to take home.

441
00:17:45,330 --> 00:17:46,570
赢不了也不能空手而回吧
We gotta get something out of this.

442
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:48,670
赶紧开始试味道
Just start tasting this stuff

443
00:17:48,670 --> 00:17:50,150
才好决定要做什么小蛋糕啊
so we can figure out what we're making.

444
00:17:52,350 --> 00:17:53,230
这味道像臭脚似的
That tastes like a foot!

445
00:17:54,470 --> 00:17:56,110
现在再加点面粉
And now I'm using some flour.

446
00:17:56,670 --> 00:17:58,570
我们烘焙时都用面粉
We use flour when we bake.

447
00:17:58,890 --> 00:17:59,650
对吧 麦克斯
Right, Max?

448
00:18:00,208 --> 00:18:01,656
好辣
Oh, that is hot.

449
00:18:02,830 --> 00:18:03,550
太辣了
Ooh, that's too hot.

450
00:18:03,970 --> 00:18:05,750
跟满身火焰的恶魔屁股一样烫[辣]
That is hot as the devil's ass!

451
00:18:06,770 --> 00:18:08,710
我的嘴要烧起来了 那臭脚味的玩意呢
Oh, my mouth is on fire. Where's that foot thing?

452
00:18:11,270 --> 00:18:13,070
让开 我来帮你 这是什么
Move over, I'll help you. What is this?

453
00:18:14,310 --> 00:18:15,230
是香草
It's vanilla.

454
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:17,110
是甜的 麦克斯 是甜的
It's sweet, Max! It's sweet.

455
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:18,630
再选个别的材料就行了
Now we just have to pick something else.

456
00:18:18,850 --> 00:18:19,810
这个吧 火腿
There, ham.

457
00:18:20,610 --> 00:18:22,170
我们可以做个香草火腿小蛋糕
We're making a vanilla ham cupcake.

458
00:18:22,310 --> 00:18:23,830
就是这个了 香草火腿
That's it! Vanilla ham!

459
00:18:24,130 --> 00:18:25,350
你就是个香草[白人]猪扒妹
You're a vanilla ham!

460
00:18:26,150 --> 00:18:27,570
很好 继续羞辱我
Good, insult me!

461
00:18:27,590 --> 00:18:29,410
你要恢复正常了 麦克斯 来吧
Yes, you're coming out of it, Max, here we go.

462
00:18:29,530 --> 00:18:30,630
我们注定要失败
We're not going anywhere.

463
00:18:30,730 --> 00:18:32,170
虽然上了我爱的节目 但我要输了
I'm on my show and I'm losing.

464
00:18:32,670 --> 00:18:33,730
别想着我们在上节目
Forget we're on the show.

465
00:18:34,670 --> 00:18:37,110
想象我们在餐厅里 奥列格大麻抽傻了
Pretend we're in the diner, and Oleg is stoned,

466
00:18:37,110 --> 00:18:38,250
而我们手边有这些材料
and we have all these ingredients

467
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:40,530
厨房外是一群吵着要小蛋糕的顾客
and we just got slammed with people who all want cupcakes.

468
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:41,570
你当时怎么教我的
What do you tell me to do?

469
00:18:41,850 --> 00:18:43,070
首先 我会叫你滚蛋
Well, first, I tell you to leave

470
00:18:43,070 --> 00:18:44,250
我才好跟奥列格一起抽大麻
So I can get stoned with Oleg.

471
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,810
如果我抽傻了
Okay, if I was stoned,

472
00:18:48,110 --> 00:18:49,610
我会怎么想灵魂食物
what would I know about soul food?

473
00:18:51,610 --> 00:18:52,050
卢达克里斯[黑人说唱歌手]
Ludacris!

474
00:18:52,050 --> 00:18:53,510
他总是在说
Is always talking about

475
00:18:53,510 --> 00:18:55,330
他有多喜欢松饼加炸鸡早餐
how much he loves waffles with chicken.

476
00:18:55,670 --> 00:18:56,770
炸鸡松饼小蛋糕
Chicken and waffle cupcake!

477
00:18:57,070 --> 00:18:58,270
没错 炸鸡松饼小蛋糕
Yes! Chicken and waffles!

478
00:18:58,630 --> 00:18:59,650
你们注意点了 女士们
You better watch it, girls.

479
00:18:59,710 --> 00:19:00,810
巨乳姐跟装模作样妞联手做的
Here comes chicken and waffles

480
00:19:00,810 --> 00:19:02,210
炸鸡松饼小蛋糕要上场了
from big boobs and try hard.

481
00:19:02,830 --> 00:19:03,950
卢达克里斯如果在这
As Ludacris would say,

482
00:19:04,150 --> 00:19:05,670
他会说 小妞让开 别挡爷的路[歌词]
move, bitch, get out the way.

483
00:19:06,390 --> 00:19:08,030
上啊 我们要使出全力
Let's go, girl. We gotta bring it.

484
00:19:08,090 --> 00:19:10,450
我们要发功 使出十成功力
We gotta shut this down. We are bringing our "A" game.

485
00:19:10,710 --> 00:19:12,390
是时候将小蛋糕生意名扬天下了
It's time to put our cupcake business on the map.

486
00:19:12,390 --> 00:19:14,190
我们一定行 天啊
We got this. Oh, my God.

487
00:19:14,190 --> 00:19:15,210
我把烂句全了说一遍
I said them all.

488
00:19:16,950 --> 00:19:19,350
清空搅拌器 我们还有时间
Empty the mixer. We still have time.

489
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:27,590
瞧这金发傻蛋
Look at the blonde dumb-dumb.

490
00:19:34,530 --> 00:19:35,830
恭喜你啊 麦克斯
Congratulations, Max!

491
00:19:38,210 --> 00:19:39,990
苏菲 我们没赢
Sophie, we didn't get it.

492
00:19:39,990 --> 00:19:42,410
恭喜你啊 卡洛琳
Oh, congratulations, Caroline!

493
00:19:43,790 --> 00:19:45,670
苏菲 我说了 我们没被选上
Sophie, I told you, we didn't get picked.

494
00:19:45,990 --> 00:19:47,010
那你要我怎么办
What am I supposed to do,

495
00:19:47,090 --> 00:19:49,230
揣着整包的碎纸花 啥事不干吗
walk around with a purse full of confetti?

496
00:19:49,990 --> 00:19:51,530
我很遗憾 姑娘们
I'm so sorry, ladies.

497
00:19:51,550 --> 00:19:52,810
但常言道
But you know what they say,

498
00:19:52,990 --> 00:19:55,430
"当上帝关上了门 你就来这工作"
when God closes a door, you work here.

499
00:19:56,310 --> 00:19:57,830
就只是出师不利嘛
It just wasn't our day.

500
00:19:57,890 --> 00:19:59,130
刚开始我们惊慌失措
We got flustered at first,

501
00:19:59,130 --> 00:20:00,870
但我们最后还是做出了好蛋糕啊
but we did end up making a great cupcake.

502
00:20:01,070 --> 00:20:01,970
就承认吧
Oh, say it.

503
00:20:02,010 --> 00:20:03,650
我们被卡特里娜飓风袭击了
We got hit by hurricane Katrina.

504
00:20:04,610 --> 00:20:05,870
的确 虽然不想相信
True. Hard to believe,

505
00:20:05,870 --> 00:20:07,230
但另一对的品牌特色更加出色
but the other team had a better brand.

506
00:20:07,230 --> 00:20:08,970
拜托哦
Oh, please.

507
00:20:09,450 --> 00:20:12,550
把失败怪罪于多年之前的天灾
Blaming it on a disaster from years ago.

508
00:20:12,910 --> 00:20:14,790
苏菲 当时你又不在 你哪能...
Well, Sophie, you weren't there, so I don't think you--

509
00:20:14,810 --> 00:20:16,090
我不想听
Oh, I don't want to hear it!

510
00:20:18,270 --> 00:20:21,550
本来你们有大好的接活机会
I mean, you had huge opportunity with duza day.

511
00:20:21,630 --> 00:20:23,890
但你们不干这正经活
But you passed on the real job

512
00:20:23,890 --> 00:20:26,450
选择不切实际的上电视找突破
waiting for your big break on the TV show,

513
00:20:26,810 --> 00:20:28,670
你们美国人都这样
Just like everyone else in America.

514
00:20:30,490 --> 00:20:32,450
想靠旁门左道 走捷径取得成功
So you tried to take a shortcut to success

515
00:20:32,450 --> 00:20:34,870
下场就是满嘴的碎纸花
and you end up with a mouth full of confetti.

516
00:20:37,930 --> 00:20:38,710
苏菲说得对
Sophie's right.

517
00:20:38,970 --> 00:20:41,350
我们上电视就只是心里想着能
We went on television with the ridiculous expectation

518
00:20:41,350 --> 00:20:42,550
不努力就轻松成功
that we'd make it overnight.

519
00:20:43,070 --> 00:20:44,270
